  "A question the spec cannot answer",
  "BLUE \u2014 changed since you last marked this reviewed",
  "DECISION",
  "DECISIONS are dashed  \u00b7  ARTIFACTS are listed right",
  "GOAL ACHIEVED \u2014 hands to Prove the whole \u00b7 Goal gate, where the\nexpert-user pass is the report the escalation contract promised.\nor a HUMAN-LEVEL BLOCKER \u2014 pause, wait. a degraded session is not\na stop: cut between pieces and resume.",
