  "Next unblocked item \u2192 build and prove \u2192 repeat",
  "OPEN on this stage \u2014 the loop MUST NOT run at all where nothing can refuse: unattended requires\nevery gate able to BLOCK from outside the model. today: 0 CI, 0 hooks, every repo. CI (MVP\nsequence) is the precondition \u2014 until it exists this page describes a loop that may not be\nswitched on.",
  "RED \u2014 cost, or a route that leaves the stage / blocks it",
  "RUNG-WIDE PROPERTY: state lives in the DECLARED\nARTIFACTS, never in the session. anything worth keeping\nis written the moment it exists. a session may die at\nany instant \u2014 the loss is bounded to the in-flight\npiece, redone from its spec.",
  "SESSION rung \u00b7 one function + a rung-wide property \u00b7 interviewed 2026-08-04\n4 \u2192 1: Drive to done (the loop) survives \u2014 the other three dissolved: property, entry gates, construction.",
  "SESSION \u2014 stage flow",
  "STOP",
  "The work order, already on disk",
  "Two stops, nothing else",
  "a cut release with its DONE condition \u2014 every piece carrying its\nown check, measurements declared, risks qualified. entered through\nthe GATES: work enters at the LOWEST rung whose declared inputs all\nexist; missing inputs push work UP, never through. nothing passes\na gate on assertion.",
  "answered at the LOWEST role with the knowledge AND the authority\nto answer it. escalates only on genuine inability \u2014 the intent-\nholding role may adjust within its declared power. the human is\nLAST, and hears only what no agent role can decide.",
  "answered \u2014 the loop continues",
  "fills the escalation contract's\nmiddle: the ladder of roles that\nmust fail before the human hears\nanything.",
  "no degradation detector\nneeded \u2014 the missing\nsignal dissolved rather\nthan found.",
  "the one licensed bypass\nis a SPIKE \u2014 declared up\nfront, cheap, built for a\nkill-or-keep decision.",
  "unattended. each piece runs BUILD's machinery on exactly its slice\n(two-tier access) and commits as it verifies. the driver holds\nnothing \u2014 state lives on disk \u2014 so it cuts and resumes fresh\nbetween pieces whenever conditions degrade. cutting costs nothing:\ncut liberally, even per piece.",
  "while an answer waits on\nthe human, nothing is\nbuilt the answer could\ninvalidate \u2014 park vs stop\nis the driving role's call."
